    " ",
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        "Elevators play an important role in residential apartments, commercial buildings, villas, and office spaces across Bangalore. As buildings become more modern and taller, elevators are expected to provide smooth, safe, and reliable performance every day. However, older elevators can slowly develop problems that affect safety, comfort, and efficiency. Many property owners ignore these warning signs until major breakdowns begin to happen regularly. This is why understanding the early signs of elevator problems is very important ",
        {
          "tag": "a",
          "attributes": {
            "href": "/before-installing-an-elevator-guide"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "strong",
              "children": ["before installing an elevator"]
            }
          ]
        },
        " or planning long-term building maintenance. Companies like BG Elevators help property owners identify outdated elevator systems and provide modern upgrade solutions that improve performance and safety."
      ]
    },
    " ",
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
